      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "The Story of Josephine Baker shares the life of the iconic performer and
    activist for racial equality. Beautifully illustrated, the book incorporates
    Augmented Technology to bring unforgettable scenes come to life. story go inside
    a circus, take a quick trip to Paris, watch Josephine prepare for her big break\u2014everything
    is a few clicks away.\n\nJoin Josephine for a journey across borders and oceans.
    From the racial struggles and tensions in her first home America to her triumphs
    and adventures in Europe, Josephine lit up the stage wherever she went."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
